                                    <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,4,0,4"><Run Text="Allowed is Coop's own behaviour. The middle choice stops players from using unstuck to escape a fight: not as a prisoner, in a battle or siege, while their army fights, with enemies nearby, or again within 5 minutes. " Foreground="#FF8EA0AE"/><Run Text="Host only leaves it to you: coop.unstuck with the player's id on the Console page." Foreground="#FFD5DEE6"/></TextBlock>
